00:32:44,322 --> 00:32:49,392
逸る鼓動は 今を刻む証だ
Racing heartbeats are proof of the present moment.

322
00:32:49,392 --> 00:32:54,612
響け 僕らの想いを乗せて
Ring out, carrying all our feelings,

323
00:32:54,612 --> 00:32:59,162
高く遠く 歌を紡いで
Spinning a song high and far!

324
00:32:59,162 --> 00:33:08,322
Lalala

325
00:33:08,322 --> 00:33:10,742
季節巡って 駆け抜けて
Running through changing seasons,

326
00:33:10,742 --> 00:33:13,372
気付けば大人になって
Before I knew it, I became an adult.

327
00:33:13,372 --> 00:33:19,032
幼い日の心は 胸の奥くすぶってた
A child's heart still lingers deep inside.

328
00:33:19,032 --> 00:33:22,372
怖いことも増えたけど
Though my fears have also grown,

329
00:33:22,372 --> 00:33:27,642
でも 今だから見える世界
The world I can see right now is unique,

330
00:33:27,642 --> 00:33:36,312
儚さの中に 確実に灯る光
A faint light glowing amidst the transient dream.

331
00:33:36,312 --> 00:33:43,462
繋いでいこう さあ 新しいステージへ
Let's keep holding on, toward a new stage!

332
00:33:43,462 --> 00:33:48,452
心の中の音を聴かせて
Let the music inside your heart play on!

333
00:33:48,452 --> 00:33:52,542
大袈裟だっていい ありのままで自分だけで
Being dramatic is totally fine.

334
00:33:52,542 --> 00:34:00,202
駆け抜けもっと いつまでもずっと 歌いながら
Burst forth even more, and sing forever,

335
00:34:00,202 --> 00:34:02,162
日々を彩って
Painting the days with melody!

336
00:34:02,162 --> 00:34:05,222
つまずいて泣いた日もあったけど
There were days of stumbling and crying,

337
00:34:05,222 --> 00:34:07,242
涙も力になる
Even tears become our strength.

338
00:34:07,242 --> 00:34:10,272
刻め HEART 鳴らせ BEAT
Engrave it, HEART! Ring it out, BEAT!

339
00:34:10,272 --> 00:34:31,052
響け 僕らのメロディ
Echo, our melody!

340
00:34:31,052 --> 00:34:33,522
ねえ あの日の夢も
Hey, those dreams of that day,

341
00:34:33,522 --> 00:34:39,232
今の自分も 描く未来も
The current me, and the future I picture—

342
00:34:39,232 --> 00:34:44,322
全て抱きしめるよ さあ 旅を続けよう
I'll embrace them all! Let's continue the journey!

343
00:34:44,322 --> 00:34:49,522
どこまででもずっと 手を繋いで
Holding hands forever and ever,

344
00:34:49,522 --> 00:34:53,502
ほら 僕らの一歩だ
Look, this is our first step!

345
00:34:53,502 --> 00:34:58,672
心のままに 音を奏でる
Let your heart play its own sound,

346
00:35:00,311 --> 00:35:02,271
いつだってそう「僕なんて」さって
Always saying things like "someone like me..."

347
00:35:02,371 --> 00:35:03,611
蹲っていたばかりのmay day
On those cowering May Days.

348
00:35:03,611 --> 00:35:05,231
つまずき泣いて「どうせ」って
Stumbling and crying, saying "oh well,"

349
00:35:05,231 --> 00:35:06,811
口癖が染みついてさ
That catchphrase became second nature.

350
00:35:06,811 --> 00:35:08,671
いつからかまた積もる焦り
Impatience has piled up again since when?

351
00:35:08,671 --> 00:35:10,311
でも胸の奥にある光
But the light deep in my chest

352
00:35:10,311 --> 00:35:12,091
繋ぐ点と線の上
Connects the dots and lines above.

353
00:35:12,091 --> 00:35:13,511
踏み出すイメージの先へ
Beyond the image of stepping forward.

354
00:35:17,511 --> 00:35:19,111
遠くたっていい
Even if it's far away,

355
00:35:19,111 --> 00:35:20,651
ほら虹をまたいで
Look, striding across the rainbow,

356
00:35:20,651 --> 00:35:24,071
さあ心のままに音を奏でる
Now, let's play our music straight from the heart.

357
00:35:24,071 --> 00:35:27,551
逸る鼓動は今を刻む証だ
This racing heartbeat is proof of carving out the present.

358
00:35:27,551 --> 00:35:29,471
響け僕らの想いを乗せて
Resonate, carrying our feelings!

359
00:35:29,471 --> 00:35:32,111
高く遠く歌を紡いで
Weaving a song high and far away,

360
00:35:32,111 --> 00:35:35,131
la la la...

361
00:36:05,151 --> 00:36:08,891
本当は分かってた行けないことだったって分かってたのに
Truth is, I knew it wasn't right, even though I knew all along.

362
00:36:08,891 --> 00:36:12,851
この手をすり抜ける全部愛に見えたの
Everything slipping through these hands looked like love.

363
00:36:12,851 --> 00:36:17,611
確かめていた言葉が形になって揺れるだけ
The words I kept checking just take shape and waver.

364
00:36:17,611 --> 00:36:20,731
弾いて描いてきっとそれだけ
Strumming and sketching, surely that's all there is.

365
00:36:20,731 --> 00:36:23,671
つまらないな正解の読み合わせ
How boring, comparing our answers to the correct ones.

366
00:36:23,671 --> 00:36:26,091
あとちょっとで分かりかけていたのに
Even though I was so close to figuring it out.

367
00:36:26,091 --> 00:36:29,251
飲んで吐いて全部忘れちゃって
Drink, vomit, and forget everything,

368
00:36:29,251 --> 00:36:33,611
水をまとった本心と鏡合わせ見つめ合えたら
Staring into true feelings clad in water as we face each other in the mirror.

369
00:36:33,611 --> 00:36:36,591
overdose 君とふたり
Overdose, just the two of us,

370
00:36:36,591 --> 00:36:39,071
やるせない日々を
Through these frustrating days.

371
00:36:39,071 --> 00:36:41,371
解像度の悪い夢を見たい
I want to dream a low-resolution nightmare.

372
00:36:41,371 --> 00:36:44,331
overdose 君とふたり
Overdose, just the two of us,

373
00:36:44,331 --> 00:36:45,871
甘いハッタリ
A sweet bluff.

374
00:36:45,871 --> 00:36:49,251
don't stop it music, darling

375
00:37:02,231 --> 00:37:06,031
本当は分かってた行けないことだったって分かってる
Did you really know? I knew it wasn't right, yet I keep knowing.

376
00:37:06,031 --> 00:37:10,131
多分時間だけが過ぎていく問答で満ちていく
Maybe only time is passing, filled with Q&As.

377
00:37:10,131 --> 00:37:16,331
言い訳する間もなく裸になってしまうだけ
No time for excuses, I'm just left stripped bare.

378
00:37:16,931 --> 00:37:21,931
きっと溜まっていくんだずっと終わってしまえばいいとふと
Surely it keeps piling up, wishing it would all just suddenly end.

379
00:37:21,931 --> 00:37:26,231
傷んで腐っていくあの甘い果実のように僕ら壊れていく
Rotting and spoiling like that sweet fruit, we break apart.

380
00:37:26,231 --> 00:37:30,431
だから踊って眠って全部忘れちゃって嘘を被ったあなたと隣り合わせ
That's why I dance, sleep, and forget all, side by side with you draped in lies.

381
00:37:30,431 --> 00:37:33,331
見つめ合えたら
Once our eyes meet.

382
00:37:33,531 --> 00:37:36,231
overdose 君とふたり
Overdose, just the two of us,

383
00:37:36,231 --> 00:37:40,031
分かりたいのに変に間の悪い嘘が嫌い
Even though I want to understand, I hate those awkwardly timed lies.

384
00:37:40,031 --> 00:37:44,331
overdose 君とふたり分かりたいのに
Overdose, just the two of us, even though I want to understand.

385
00:37:44,331 --> 00:37:48,931
two step from hell with me, darling

386
00:38:08,131 --> 00:38:11,131
overdose 君とふたり
Overdose, just the two of us,

387
00:38:11,131 --> 00:38:16,231
やるせない日々を解像度の悪い夢を見たい
Through frustrating days, I want to dream a blurred nightmare.

388
00:38:16,231 --> 00:38:20,131
overdose 君とふたり甘いハッタリ
Overdose, just the two of us, a sweet bluff.

389
00:38:20,131 --> 00:38:24,531
don't stop it music, darling

390
00:38:24,531 --> 00:38:27,331
overdose 君とふたり
Overdose, just the two of us,

391
00:38:27,331 --> 00:38:32,531
分からないけど変に間の悪い嘘でもいいから
I don't understand, but even awkwardly timed lies are fine, so

392
00:38:32,531 --> 00:38:36,631
どうせ君とふたり甘いハッタリ
Just you and me, a sweet bluff.

393
00:38:36,631 --> 00:38:41,131
don't stop it music, darling

394
00:38:41,131 --> 00:38:56,631
don't stop it music, darling

395
00:39:05,471 --> 00:39:08,831
はい、ということで、イェーイ！MCいきたいと思います！
Yes, and with that, yay! Let's move on to the MC segment!

396
00:39:08,831 --> 00:39:12,091
じゃあ、1人じゃ寂しいので、はい！おいで、おいで！
Since being alone is lonely, come on over!

397
00:39:12,731 --> 00:39:13,751
イェーイ！イェーイ！
Yay! Yay!

398
00:39:16,931 --> 00:39:18,631
みんな歌ったことあるのかな？
I wonder if everyone's sung this before?

399
00:39:18,631 --> 00:39:22,131
MCはやっていきたいと思います！いぇーい！
Let's do the MC! Yay!

400
00:39:22,131 --> 00:39:23,931
かっこよかったね、ありがとう！
That was so cool, thank you!

401
00:39:24,131 --> 00:39:28,931
今日お互いのね、歌った曲に触れていきましょうか！
Let's talk about each other's songs we sang today!

402
00:39:28,931 --> 00:39:30,531
はい、何歌ったんですか？
Yes, what did you sing?

403
00:39:30,531 --> 00:39:36,631
私はね、ギターと孤独と青い星とOverdoseを歌わせていただきました！
I sang "Guitar and Loneliness and Blue Planet" and "Overdose"!

404
00:39:36,631 --> 00:39:38,331
歌った歌った！
You sang them!

405
00:39:38,331 --> 00:39:41,131
やめて、かっこよかったね！
Stop it, it was so cool!

406
00:39:45,931 --> 00:39:51,631
Overdoseは流行りの曲、だからちょっと歌ってみて…
"Overdose" is a trendy song, so I tried singing it...

407
00:39:51,631 --> 00:39:59,131
トワさんに合うよって選んでくれた曲を今回歌わせていただきました！
And this was the song chosen for me because it would suit me!

408
00:40:00,491 --> 00:40:01,011
待ってたよ？
Waiting for us?

409
00:40:01,151 --> 00:40:01,671
ありがとう！
Thank you!

410
00:40:01,741 --> 00:40:02,281
確かに！
True!

411
00:40:02,281 --> 00:40:03,261
歌いやすかった！
It was easy to sing!

412
00:40:03,341 --> 00:40:03,701
おー！
Oh!

413
00:40:04,001 --> 00:40:04,751
イエーイ！
Yeah!

414
00:40:05,301 --> 00:40:05,971
ね、サイハイ！
Right, Saihi!

415
00:40:06,271 --> 00:40:07,051
ありがとね！
Thank you!

416
00:40:07,281 --> 00:40:08,941
で、わためが、わためはね？
And Watame, Watame...

417
00:40:09,121 --> 00:40:12,001
インディジフォーエバーと合せstepを出させていただきまして！
...released "Indie-gi Forever" and "Awase Step"!

418
00:40:12,901 --> 00:40:13,491
おー！
Oh!

419
00:40:13,491 --> 00:40:14,801
合せstepめっちゃよかった！
"Awase Step" was so good!

420
00:40:15,261 --> 00:40:17,761
嬉しい！これが新曲なんだけども、うん
I'm so glad! This is our new song, yeah.

421
00:40:18,081 --> 00:40:26,691
今までの、私達が出してきた楽曲の歌詞が入ってたり、曲名が入ってたりする、この週年にぴったりの曲になってるんですよー！
It has lyrics and titles from the songs we've released so far,
making it the perfect song for this anniversary!

422
00:40:27,201 --> 00:40:32,551
いや、そうなんだよ！トワ様リハーサルで聴いてて、すごい「エモい曲、いい曲だね」って言ったら
Yeah, exactly! When I listened to Towa-sama during rehearsal,
I thought, "What an emotional, great song."

423
00:40:32,891 --> 00:40:40,501
歌詞とかね、はい、曲名が入ってらっしゃるっていうのを教えてもらったんで、もう先にちょっと味わっちゃいましたー！
She told me that the lyrics and song titles are included in it,
so I got to taste it a bit early!

424
00:40:41,201 --> 00:40:42,671
でも、でもね！
But, but you know,

425
00:40:42,671 --> 00:40:43,911
みんな味わえるんですよ、これ！
everyone gets to taste it too, you know!

426
00:40:44,351 --> 00:40:44,981
え？なんですカ？
Eh? What is it?

427
00:40:45,121 --> 00:40:45,541
この後？
After this?

428
00:40:45,891 --> 00:40:50,741
なに？この合せstepの、なに？MVが、わためチャンネルで投稿されます！
What? The MV for this "Awase Step"
will be posted on Watame's channel!

429
00:40:51,251 --> 00:40:52,351
なにー！？
What?!

430
00:40:52,351 --> 00:40:53,221
反応いいな！
Such a good reaction!

431
00:40:53,451 --> 00:40:53,911
気持ちいー！
Feels so good!

432
00:40:55,181 --> 00:40:56,381
ありがてぇ、ありがてぇ
So grateful, so grateful.

433
00:40:56,661 --> 00:40:57,801
ぜひ見てください！
Please check it out!

434
00:40:57,881 --> 00:40:58,481
見てねー！
Watch it!

435
00:41:00,101 --> 00:41:05,621
そして、そして！なんと、じゃじゃーん！ライブショー！
And, and! What's more, ta-da! Live show!

436
00:41:06,291 --> 00:41:08,721
お互いデュエット初めてだね、初めてだね！
It's our first duet together, our first time!

437
00:41:09,261 --> 00:41:13,341
ちょっとシナジーがあったんじゃない？このヒラヒラとか、確かにね！
Didn't we have some synergy? These frills and all, true!

438
00:41:14,061 --> 00:41:15,501
ちょっとスクショタイムするか！
Let's do a screenshot time!

439
00:41:15,691 --> 00:41:16,291
しようよ！
Let's do it!

440
00:41:16,471 --> 00:41:19,641
あ、ポニーテールでね、ピースピース！
Ah, with ponytails, peace peace!

441
00:41:21,611 --> 00:41:24,611
ピースピースだった？ピースピース、ハート？
Was it peace peace? Peace peace, heart?

442
00:41:25,191 --> 00:41:32,111
あ、これ、ま、やって…おい！笑笑。やったところで！
Ah, this, well, do... Hey! Lol. Now that we did it!

443
00:41:33,391 --> 00:41:36,571
えー、そうでしょう、我々なんと今日で…
Um, that's right, today we...

444
00:41:37,911 --> 00:41:39,081
5周年！
5th anniversary!

445
00:41:39,261 --> 00:41:40,571
5周年か！早いなあ
5th anniversary! Time flies.

446
00:41:40,901 --> 00:41:44,401
いやもう5周年になっていたらもう我々はもうね、おっほねさんですから！
I mean, once it's 5 years, we're already seasoned veterans!

447
00:41:44,651 --> 00:41:45,481
おっほねさん？
Seasoned veterans?

448
00:41:45,601 --> 00:41:46,581
おっほねさんです！
Seasoned veterans!

449
00:41:46,581 --> 00:41:49,641
5年ね、5ね…骨ね？骨さん!だってもう骨さんいっぱい入ってきたでしょ！
5 years, 5 ye... bones? Bone-san! Cause a lot of 'bones' have come in!

450
00:41:51,251 --> 00:41:53,451
確かにね、もう中堅ぐらいになっちゃったよ
True, we're already around mid-tier.

451
00:41:53,681 --> 00:41:55,921
ちょっともう、おばさんです笑笑
We're kind of old ladies already, lol.

452
00:41:56,701 --> 00:42:00,471
いやいやいや、まだまだですよ！まだ、まだ！
No no no, not yet! Still, still!

453
00:42:00,821 --> 00:42:05,821
じゃあちょっとちなみになんですけど、6年目に入るわけですよ。6年目の目標を聞いてもいいですか？
Well, by the way, we're entering our 6th year. Can I ask your goal for the 6th year?

454
00:42:06,781 --> 00:42:12,001
いや、まだまだね、ピッチピチに、ね、若い子には負けねえぞっていう気持ちでね、がんばっていきたいと思います！
Well, we're still full of youth, and with the feeling of not losing to the young ones, we'll do our best!

455
00:42:12,501 --> 00:42:14,491
おばさんやないか！
Aren't you just old ladies!

456
00:42:14,801 --> 00:42:17,041
もう負けてるやないかピチピチって言ってる時点でね！
You're already losing the moment you say you're youthful!

457
00:42:18,941 --> 00:42:22,461
自分がピチピチじゃないって言ってるやないか！ピチピチだよ！
You're saying you're not youthful! We are youthful!

458
00:42:22,601 --> 00:42:24,601
そうだね、トワ様はなんかあるの？
That's right, does Towa-sama have anything?

459
00:42:24,601 --> 00:42:27,921
そうですね、6年目は健康に暮らしたいですね
Well, in our 6th year, I want to live healthily.

460
00:42:28,171 --> 00:42:29,561
おばさんやないか！
Aren't you an old lady!

461
00:42:29,981 --> 00:42:34,401
あー苦しい！おばさんは言い過ぎた、ごめん！
Ah painful! 'Old lady' was going too far, sorry!

462
00:42:34,921 --> 00:42:38,041
いや、でもでも大丈夫ですよ、全然、全然気にしてないですから
No, but it's totally fine, I'm not minding it at all.

463
00:42:38,401 --> 00:42:39,341
そうだよね、うん
That's right, yeah.

464
00:42:39,341 --> 00:42:41,431
もう言われ慣れてるから。おい！
I'm used to hearing it already. Hey!

465
00:42:42,021 --> 00:42:44,531
気にしてるじゃん、おい！あ、ごめんごめん、すいません
You do mind, hey! Ah, sorry sorry, excuse me.

466
00:42:45,531 --> 00:42:47,601
言われ慣れてんだよ。もうこんなもう
I'm used to it. Already like this,

467
00:42:48,481 --> 00:42:51,671
次のおばあちゃんの曲いこうじゃん！一緒に歌うんでしょ？
Let's go to the next 'granny' song! We're singing together right?

468
00:42:52,171 --> 00:42:53,451
そう、まだ待たないよ！
Right, don't wait yet!

469
00:42:53,631 --> 00:42:54,821
そうだよ、そうだよ！
That's right, that's right!

470
00:42:55,661 --> 00:43:02,291
じゃあちょっと次の曲、あのちょっと落ち着かして、落ち着かして、いきたいと思います。はい
Well then, let's calm down a bit for the next song and go. Yes.

471
00:43:02,541 --> 00:43:03,351
一緒にタイトルコールしてね？
Let's do the title call together, okay?

472
00:43:03,631 --> 00:43:04,101
はい！
Yes!

473
00:43:04,101 --> 00:43:04,741
はい！
Yes!

474
00:43:04,741 --> 00:43:05,301
では、聞いてください！
Now, please listen!

475
00:43:06,041 --> 00:43:07,901
メリーゴーランド！
Merry-go-round!

476
00:43:30,611 --> 00:43:38,351
好きになるって どんな こと？ 新しい 自分に 会う こと
What is it like to fall in love?
It's meeting a new self

477
00:43:39,011 --> 00:43:44,461
好きと 口に できなかった こと
Things I couldn't say I love you

478
00:43:46,511 --> 00:43:54,361
貴方の 幸せ の 中、 私 が 居なかった こと
The fact that I wasn't in your happiness

479
00:43:54,881 --> 00:43:59,511
それを 受け入れて しまった こと
The fact that I was able to accept that

480
00:44:02,501 --> 00:44:08,671
一人 泣いていた バスタブ の 中
Crying alone inside the bathtub

481
00:44:10,061 --> 00:44:17,041
顔 が 痛くて 貴方に 会いたくて
My face hurts, I want to see you

482
00:44:17,521 --> 00:44:25,741
アイシテル を もう 何度 私、 口に した の だろ
How many times have I said "I love you"?

483
00:44:26,301 --> 00:44:33,871
ななのに どうして 今 傍 に 誰も 居ない の
Yet why is there no one by my side now?

484
00:44:34,171 --> 00:44:41,531
アイシテル って もう 何度 私 耳 に した の だろ
How many times have I heard "I love you"?

485
00:44:42,021 --> 00:44:49,921
寂しさ だけ が この 胸 に 残って いる の です
Only loneliness remains in this chest

486
00:44:55,061 --> 00:44:59,146
好きに なるって どんな こと
What is it like to fall in love?

487
00:45:00,483 --> 00:45:02,263
いつだってそう「僕なんて」さって
Always telling myself, "A guy like me..."

488
00:45:02,263 --> 00:45:05,063
俯いてばかりのMayday
A constant Mayday with my head bowed down.

489
00:45:05,063 --> 00:45:07,913
つまづいて泣いて「どうせ」って口癖が染み付いてさ
Stumbling, crying, letting "oh well" become my habit.

490
00:45:10,113 --> 00:45:13,413
いつからかまた積もる焦り
Before I knew it, impatience piled up again.

491
00:45:13,413 --> 00:45:17,713
でも胸の奥にある光
But the light deep within my chest

492
00:45:18,313 --> 00:45:21,813
繋ぐ点と線の上
connects the dots and lines above.

493
00:45:21,813 --> 00:45:25,563
踏み出すイメージの先へ
Head beyond the image of stepping forward.

494
00:45:26,113 --> 00:45:30,113
遠くたっていい ほら 虹をまたいで
It's okay if it's far, look, stepping across the rainbow.

495
00:45:30,113 --> 00:45:34,213
さあ 心のままに音を奏でる
Now, play the music straight from the heart.

496
00:45:34,213 --> 00:45:38,413
逸る鼓動は今を刻む証だ
This racing heartbeat proves we are marking the present.

497
00:45:38,413 --> 00:45:42,013
響け 僕らの想いを乗せて
Resound, carrying our feelings,

498
00:45:42,013 --> 00:45:45,513
高く遠く 歌を紡いで
spinning a song high and far.

499
00:45:45,513 --> 00:45:49,413
la la la

500
00:45:49,913 --> 00:45:53,513
季節巡って 駆け抜けて
Seasons pass, running through them,

501
00:45:53,513 --> 00:45:57,413
気づけば大人になって
before I knew it, I became an adult.

502
00:45:57,413 --> 00:46:01,513
幼い日の心は胸の奥すぶっすてた
The heart of my childhood was cast away deep inside.

503
00:46:01,513 --> 00:46:05,613
怖いことも増えたけど
Things to fear increased as well,

504
00:46:05,613 --> 00:46:09,713
でも今だから見え得る世界
but this is a world only visible now.

505
00:46:09,713 --> 00:46:13,813
僅かの中に確かり灯る光
A light burning surely within the faintness—

506
00:46:13,813 --> 00:46:17,513
繋いでいこう
let's keep connecting it.

507
00:46:17,513 --> 00:46:21,513
さあ 新しいステージへ
Now, onto a new stage,

508
00:46:21,513 --> 00:46:25,713
心の中の音を聴かせて
let me hear the sound inside your heart.

509
00:46:25,713 --> 00:46:29,813
大袈裟だっていい
It's okay if it's exaggerated,

510
00:46:29,813 --> 00:46:33,613
ありのままの自分で
just be your true self

511
00:46:33,613 --> 00:46:37,513
咲き誇れもっと
and bloom more proudly,

512
00:46:37,513 --> 00:46:41,713
いつまでもずっと
forever and ever.

513
00:46:41,713 --> 00:46:45,513
歌いながら日々を紡いで
Spinning our days while singing.

514
00:46:45,513 --> 00:46:49,413
俯いて泣いた日もあった
There were days I bowed my head and cried,

515
00:46:49,413 --> 00:46:53,413
だけど涙も力になる
but even tears become strength.

516
00:46:53,413 --> 00:46:55,413
刻め heart
Engrave your heart,

517
00:46:55,413 --> 00:46:57,513
鳴らし beat
ring out the beat,

518
00:46:57,513 --> 00:47:01,013
響け僕らのメロディ
resound our melody!

519
00:47:01,013 --> 00:47:05,313
ねえ あの日の夢も
Hey, the dream of that day,

520
00:47:05,313 --> 00:47:08,913
今の自分も 描く未来も
my current self, and the future I draw—

521
00:47:08,913 --> 00:47:12,913
全て抱きしめるよ
I will embrace it all.

522
00:47:12,913 --> 00:47:17,013
さあ 旅を続けよう
Now, let's continue the journey

523
00:47:17,013 --> 00:47:21,213
どこまでもずっと 手を繋いで
holding hands forever wherever we go.

524
00:47:21,213 --> 00:47:25,213
ほら 僕らの1歩だ
Look, it's our first step.

525
00:48:18,661 --> 00:48:21,361
さあ 眠眠打破 昼夜逆転 VOX AC30W
Now, breaking drowsiness, day-night reversal, VOX AC30W.

526
00:48:21,361 --> 00:48:24,961
テレキャスター背負った サブカルボーイがバンド仲間にやっほー
A subculture boy with a Telecaster says "Yahoo" to his bandmates.

527
00:48:24,961 --> 00:48:28,361
アルバイトはネクラモード 対バンにはATフィールド
Part-time job in gloomy mode, an AT field for joint gigs.

528
00:48:28,361 --> 00:48:31,661
“人見知り”宣言で逃げる気か boy
Planning to run away by declaring yourself "shy," boy?

529
00:48:31,661 --> 00:48:35,361
ゆーて お坊っちゃんお嬢ちゃん お金も才能も
Come on, little lord and lady, money and talent—

530
00:48:35,361 --> 00:48:38,661
なまじっかあるだけ厄介でやんす
having them just makes things troublesome.

531
00:48:38,661 --> 00:48:40,961
Boys be ambitious... (はいはい) like this old man
Boys be ambitious... (yes, yes) like this old man.

532
00:48:40,961 --> 00:48:44,961
長い前髪 君誰の信者 信者 信者
Long bangs, whose believer are you, believer, believer?

533
00:48:44,961 --> 00:48:47,961
勘違いすんな 教祖はおまえだ
Make no mistake, the cult leader is you.

534
00:48:47,961 --> 00:48:52,361
ロキロキのロックンロックンロール
Roki-roki's rock 'n' roll,

535
00:48:52,361 --> 00:48:56,961
かき鳴らすエレクトリックギターは don't stop! don't stop!
strumming the electric guitar, don't stop! don't stop!

536
00:48:56,961 --> 00:49:00,961
さあ 君のすべてを曝け出してみせろよ
Now, bare everything you are and show it to me.

537
00:49:00,961 --> 00:49:04,961
ロキロキのロックンロックンロール
Roki-roki's rock 'n' roll,

538
00:49:04,961 --> 00:49:07,361
さあ 日進月歩 いい曲書いてる? 動画ふえてる?
Now, daily progress—writing good tunes? videos increasing?

539
00:49:07,361 --> 00:49:13,361
「知名度あるけど 人気はそんなにないから色々大変ですね。」
"You have fame, but not that much popularity, so things are tough."

540
00:49:13,361 --> 00:49:16,361
はっきり言うなよ 匿名アイコン
Don't say it so clearly, anonymous icon.

541
00:49:16,361 --> 00:49:19,361
はっきり見せない 写真のアイコン
Never showing clearly, profile photo icon.

542
00:49:19,361 --> 00:49:22,361
いい歳こいて 自意識未だ boy
Acting grown yet still full of self-consciousness, boy.

543
00:49:22,361 --> 00:49:26,361
ぶっちゃけんどんだけ 賢くあざとくやったって
Frankly, no matter how smartly and cunningly you play,

544
00:49:26,361 --> 00:49:29,361
10年後に メイクは落ちてんだろう
your makeup will wear off in 10 years.

545
00:49:29,361 --> 00:49:31,961
Boys be ambitious... (はいはい) like this old man
Boys be ambitious... (yes, yes) like this old man.

546
00:49:31,961 --> 00:49:35,361
生き抜くためだ キメろ take a "selfy" "selfy" "selfy"
It's to survive, strike a pose, take a "selfy" "selfy" "selfy".

547
00:49:35,361 --> 00:49:38,361
死ぬんじゃねえぞ お互いにな!
Don't you dare die on me, let's both survive!

548
00:49:38,361 --> 00:49:42,361
ロキロキのロックンロックンロール
Roki-roki's rock 'n' roll,

549
00:49:42,361 --> 00:49:46,361
薄っぺらいラブソングでもいい don't stop! don't stop!
even a shallow love song is fine, don't stop! don't stop!

550
00:49:46,361 --> 00:49:49,961
さあ 目の中のあの子を撃ち抜いてみせろよ
Now, try to shoot through that girl in your eyes.

551
00:49:49,961 --> 00:49:53,961
ロキロキのロックンロックンロール
Roki-roki's rock 'n' roll,

552
00:49:53,961 --> 00:49:59,161
お茶を濁してちゃ 満足できない
You can't be satisfied just beating around the bush.

553
00:50:00,536 --> 00:50:01,936
さあ 睡眠打破 昼夜逆転
So wake up, break sleep, day and night reversed.

554
00:50:01,936 --> 00:50:02,836
VOX AC30W

555
00:50:02,836 --> 00:50:05,096
テレキャスター背負ったサブカルボーイが バンド仲間にやっほー
The subculture boy with a Telecaster says hello to his bandmates

556
00:50:05,276 --> 00:50:06,976
アルバイトはネクラモード 対バンドにはATフィールド
Part-time job is gloomy mode, AT field against other bands

557
00:50:06,976 --> 00:50:08,876
“人見知り”宣言で逃げる気か boy
Planning to run away by declaring you're "shy", boy?

558
00:50:22,026 --> 00:50:25,276
ゆーて お坊っちゃんお嬢ちゃん お金も才能も なまじっかあるだけ厄介でやんす
Well, little lord and lady, having just enough money and talent is just a nuisance

559
00:50:25,276 --> 00:50:26,226
boys be ambitious...

560
00:50:26,226 --> 00:50:26,726
（はいはい）
(Yeah, yeah)

561
00:50:26,726 --> 00:50:28,326
like this old man

562
00:50:28,526 --> 00:50:31,726
長い前髪 君誰の信者 信仰 信仰 勘違いすんなよ 教祖はオマエだ
Long bangs, whose follower are you? Believe! Make no mistake, you are the cult leader

563
00:50:31,926 --> 00:50:35,626
ロキロキのロックンロックンロール かき鳴らすエレクトリックギターは don't stop! don't stop!
Roki-roki rock 'n' roll, strumming the electric guitar, don't stop! don't stop!

564
00:50:46,876 --> 00:50:48,976
さあ 君の全てを 暴き出してみせろよ
Come on, try exposing your everything

565
00:50:49,076 --> 00:50:49,776
baby baby baby

566
00:50:49,776 --> 00:50:53,976
baby baby baby baby baby

567
00:51:02,026 --> 00:51:04,626
ロキロキのロックンロックンロール かき鳴らすエレクトリックギターは
Roki-roki rock 'n' roll, strumming the electric guitar

568
00:51:04,626 --> 00:51:07,026
don't stop! don't stop! さあ 君の全てを
Don't stop! Don't stop! Come on, your everything

569
00:51:07,026 --> 00:51:11,926
暴き出してみせろよ ロキロキのロックンロックンロール
Expose it and show me, roki-roki rock 'n' roll

570
00:51:24,476 --> 00:51:27,976
死ぬんじゃねぇぞ お互いにな！ 死に金のわざ お互い様
Don't you dare die, both of us!

571
00:51:55,476 --> 00:51:59,376
みんな、4期生5周年記念ライブ見てくれてありがとう！
Thank you everyone for watching the 5th Anniversary Live!

572
